LegalEase – Project Report
1. Introduction
LegalEase is a simple web-based educational platform designed to make basic legal information easier to understand and access.
2. Problem Statement
Many people find legal information difficult because legal terms and procedures can be complex. A simple information platform can help users understand common topics before seeking professional assistance.
3. Objectives
Provide simple legal information.
Help users explore basic rights.
Give general guidance about common legal topics.
Create a user-friendly interface.
Demonstrate HTML, CSS and JavaScript skills.
4. Features
Responsive home page.
Services section.
Interactive Rights Finder.
Simple question-and-answer section.
Mobile-friendly design.
Legal disclaimer.
5. Technologies Used
HTML5, CSS3 and JavaScript.
6. Future Enhancements
Multilingual support.
Searchable legal information database.
User login.
Appointment request feature.
Integration with verified legal resources.
AI-based information retrieval with strong safety and source verification.
7. Conclusion
LegalEase demonstrates how a simple web application can organize general legal information in an accessible way. The project can be expanded with verified legal resources and additional features.
